# Admin detail URLs + breadcrumbs

## Canonical detail path

Entity **detail** (and its tabs) use a **top-level** resource path — do **not** nest under the parent:

```text
/{entityPlural}/:id
/{entityPlural}/:id/{tab}
```

Examples:

* Branch detail: `/branches/:branchId`, `/branches/:branchId/pricing`
* List of children under a parent may still nest: `/organizations/:orgId/branches`

Do **not** create `/organizations/:orgId/branches/:branchId` (or similar) for detail.

## Breadcrumbs

Top-level detail URLs must **not** drop the parent trail. Build crumbs from entity relations (FK), not from URL nesting:

```text
{Parent list} › {Parent name} › {Child list} › {Child name} [› {Tab}]
```

Example when opening a branch from an organization:

```text
Tổ chức › {Org} › Chi nhánh › {Branch} [› Bảng giá]
```

Deep links to `/branches/:id` should still resolve the parent (e.g. `branch.organization_id`) and show the same trail.

## Redirects

Do not add permanent redirects from old nested detail URLs unless product explicitly asks. Update in-app links to the canonical top-level path.
